1
00:00:03,962 --> 00:00:09,322
Sir, I come from a poor family—I’ve grown
up fighting through a lot of hardship.

2
00:00:14,549 --> 00:00:17,884
All my time goes into putting
food on the table for my family.

3
00:00:17,884 --> 00:00:20,450
How am I supposed to get
involved in the organization?

4
00:00:25,089 --> 00:00:26,688
Once you come here, even
a mute will start talking.

5
00:00:26,688 --> 00:00:27,808
Can you sleep without the water flowing?

6
00:00:31,168 --> 00:00:34,302
We’ve even got tea leaves to read.

7
00:00:34,302 --> 00:00:36,989
Even your god doesn’t know that.

8
00:00:42,497 --> 00:00:44,526
So I’m the terrorist, huh?

9
00:00:44,526 --> 00:00:48,585
You people deserve to be
starved and tortured to death.

10
00:00:55,378 --> 00:00:58,927
If I step outside from here and
you run into me on the road,

11
00:00:58,927 --> 00:01:00,448
you’ll probably kill me, won’t you?

12
00:01:00,448 --> 00:01:03,997
I don’t hold any grudge against you,
sir. I haven’t learned to kill people.

13
00:01:08,309 --> 00:01:11,966
I’ve seen the atrocities committed
in the name of revolution.

14
00:01:11,966 --> 00:01:14,893
You just want to hold on to power.

15
00:01:14,893 --> 00:01:18,917
This whole sham—this act—is for
the greed of power, isn’t it?

16
00:01:23,797 --> 00:01:27,251
I don’t know how your self-interest
got mixed into all this.

17
00:01:27,251 --> 00:01:29,763
I only know what I want from you.

18
00:01:29,763 --> 00:01:34,160
Who gets killed, who gets disappeared—it's
all in your hands, I know that, look.

19
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:38,556
But be clear about one thing: I
will not bow to your royal rule.

